.TH cmpblockmaps "1" "" "The scalpel3 Blockmap Comparator" "The scalpel3 Blockmap Comparator"

.SH NAME
cmpblockmaps \- Compare two scalpel3 blockmaps

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B cmpblockmaps
blockmap_filename_1
blockmap_filename_2

.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
\fBcmpblockmaps\fR compares two scalpel3 blockmap files and outputs the differences. Both blockmaps must represent the same number of blocks and have valid block sizes (>= 512 and multiples of 512).
.PP
Use blockmaps for the same image and block size for a meaningful comparison.
The files are not modified.

.SH OPTIONS
.PP
This utility takes exactly two positional arguments: the filenames of the two blockmaps to compare.

.SH EXIT STATUS
Returns zero when comparison succeeds, even if differences are found.
Returns nonzero if the files cannot be read or compared. Unlike
\fBdiff\fR(1), the exit status does not indicate whether the inputs differ.

.SH SEE ALSO
.BR scalpel3 (1),
.BR crblockmap (1),
.BR modblockmap (1),
.BR blockmapfs (1),
.BR fragmentator (1)

